  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upcycle\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_567281.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fupcycle!\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/upcycle!?logo=modrinth&amp;label=&amp;suffix= &amp;style=flat&amp;color=242629&amp;labelColor=5ca424&amp;logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upcycle\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/567281(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Supported Versions\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hmaD7Se\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&amp;logo=discord&amp;style=flat&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Upcycle/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"400\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>📖 模组介绍</h2><p>这个轻量级的原版增强模组允许你将腐肉、蜘蛛眼等垃圾物品放入堆肥桶升级为骨粉！</p><h4>可升级物品：</h4><ul>\n<li>腐肉</li>\n<li>蜘蛛眼</li>\n<li>发酵蛛眼</li>\n<li>毒马铃薯</li>\n<li>兔子脚</li>\n<li>海龟蛋</li>\n<li>嗅探兽蛋</li>\n<li>幽匿脉络</li>\n<li>闪烁的西瓜片</li>\n<li>金苹果</li>\n<li>金胡萝卜</li>\n</ul><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>🗃️ 依赖项</h2><h3>必装前置：</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Magma Core</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>提供基础代码和更新检查器等核心功能</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magma-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a hr